               EXEC CICS FORMATTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
                         MMDDYYYY(DATE1)
                         TIME(TIME1)
               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       RECONCILE-NCD-YEARS-0214.
